     9	/**
    10	 * `setModule` can wait on an unsaved-changes confirmation, return without
    11	 * navigating when the user declines, and drop a switch made within 100 ms of
    12	 * the previous one. A tool must therefore await it and confirm the app really
    13	 * ended up on the target before claiming it navigated.
